{"product_id":"nicotine","title":"Nicotine","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the much acclaimed author of Mislaid and The Wallcreeper, a fierce and audaciously funny novel of families—both the ones we’re born into and the ones we create—a story of obsession, idealism, and ownership, centered around a young woman who inherits her bohemian late father’s childhood home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e“She wills her body to be equally wraithlike. Not sodden, not heavy, not dead, but filled with crackling, electric life, like a stale Marlboro on fire.”\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eUnemployed business major, Penny, has rebelled against her family her whole life – by being the conventional one. Her mother was a member of a South American tribe; her father was a Jewish Shamanist with a psychedelic 'healing centre'. But everything changes when her father dies and Penny inherits his childhood home. Left weightless and unmoored after being the only member of her family with time for her dying father, Penny then finds his property occupied by a group of squatters, united in defence of smokers' rights – and herself unexpectedly besotted with them, particularly Rob, the hot bicycle-and-tobacco activist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eTotally addictive and dangerously good, Nicotine is a fiercely funny novel in which passion is politics and nonviolence is the opposite of surrender.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Nell Zink\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780008179212\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 22 x 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41763046097049,"sku":"13RA9780008179212","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/81pQEOldDHL._UF1000_1000_QL80.jpg?v=1763391169","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/nicotine","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}